# Data pipeline — large raw downloads are not committed; see data/sources.json
# for URL/size/SHA256 of every file so they can be re-downloaded exactly.
# Exceptions: small hand-written checklists/validation data meant to be
# tracked (download instructions, HND statistik snapshot) — not raw data
# dumps themselves.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/gkd/
data/raw/gkd/*
!data/raw/gkd/README.md
!data/raw/ehyd/
data/raw/ehyd/*
!data/raw/ehyd/README.md
!data/raw/hnd/
data/raw/hnd/*
!data/raw/hnd/statistik.json
data-pipeline/venv/
